  nameEnglish: Arctic Code
  descriptionEnglish: Designed to freeze the genetic code of enemies, but it hasn't
    proven very efficient at that. Because, well, frozen DNA doesn't really serve
    any purpose.
  nameChinese: "\u6781\u5BD2\u5BC6\u7801"
  descriptionChinese: "\u4E3A\u51BB\u4F4F\u654C\u4EBA\u7684\u57FA\u56E0\u7F16\u7801\u800C\u8BBE\u8BA1\uFF0C\u4F46\u4ECE\u672A\u88AB\u8BC1\u660E\u6709\u6548\u679C\u3002\u56E0\u4E3A\u561B\uFF0C\u51BB\u4F4FDNA\u5B9E\u5728\u662F\u6CA1\u4EC0\u4E48\u7528\u3002"
  namePortuguese: "C\xF3digo \xC1rtico"
  descriptionPortuguese: "Projetado para congelar o c\xF3digo gen\xE9tico dos inimigos,
    mas n\xE3o tem se mostrado muito eficiente nisso. Afinal, o DNA congelado n\xE3o
    serve realmente para nenhum prop\xF3sito."
  nameSpanish: "C\xF3digo \xC1rtico"
  weaponDescriptionSpanish: "Dise\xF1ado para congelar el c\xF3digo gen\xE9tico de
    los enemigos, pero no ha demostrado ser muy eficiente en eso. Porque, bueno,
    el ADN congelado no sirve para nada."
